              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सेनापती — senāpatī — \"a commander\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सेनापतीने सैन्याला थांबायला सांगितलं. senāpatīne sainyālā thāmbāylā sāṅgitlaṁ. The commander told the army to halt."
