          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सेनापती (senāpatī) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit senāpati, 'the lord of an army, a general' (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
