              "text": "पहारा देणे — pahārā deṇe — \"to stand guard\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "दोन सैनिकांनी रात्रभर दारावर पहारा दिला. don sainikānnī rātrabhar dārāvar pahārā dilā. Two soldiers stood guard at the gate all night."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने पहारा दिला, tyāne pahārā dilā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The place guarded takes -वर; पहारा is masculine, so the past is पहारा दिला."
            }
          ]
        },
